flowchart LR
  Req[Request] --> Comp{Compress?}
  Comp --> RL[Rate limit]
  RL --> Cache{Cache lookup}
  Cache -->|hit| Out[Response + zero bill]
  Cache -->|miss| Bud[Budget reserve]
  Bud --> Call[Model call + retries]
  Call --> Led[Usage ledger]
  Led --> Dash[Dashboard]
  Call --> CacheW[Cache write]
